cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "apxchol: scalable approximate Cholesky preconditioning for Laplacian and SDDM systems"
abstract: >-
  A C++23 library implementing a parallel approximate-Cholesky preconditioner
  (Kyng-Sachdeva-style elimination with tree-based clique sampling) for graph
  Laplacian and SDDM linear systems, with an Eigen-compatible interface, OpenMP
  and cuSPARSE triangular-solve backends, a CLI solver, and Python and Octave
  bindings.
authors:
